      "content": "thanks. it's just that everything feels so... pointless. like, why do we even bother building these lives and these connections if it’s just going to be ripped away? it feels like the only thing that's actually real was that connection, and now that it's gone, the rest of it just feels like a hollow performance. i'm just so tired of the pretending. it feels like i'm just waiting for the void to swallow everything anyway.",
